{"unit_id":"YuyuYuu-wyt__dsh-image-drag#card-zh","repo":"YuyuYuu-wyt/dsh-image-drag","commit":"090977b67c1989b9610859469224553d3caa2579","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"图片拖动是面向 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）Web 客户端右侧边栏的界面插件，通过浏览器端模块加载器挂载，不改动 Host 侧功能。它让用户按住 Ctrl 并用鼠标左键拖动已放大的图片或 PDF 预览来平移画面，也为每个停靠分栏加入独立的清空按钮。按钮会保留该栏的开始页，双栏操作不会清空另一栏。实现沿用预览滚动区域，并保留原有缩放交互。适合需要浏览大图或文档预览并整理侧栏标签的 DSH 用户；需要 DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 或更新版本，不需要额外密钥或服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:600-634","lib/index.js:4-15"]}
{"unit_id":"YuyuYuu-wyt__dsh-image-drag#card-en","repo":"YuyuYuu-wyt/dsh-image-drag","commit":"090977b67c1989b9610859469224553d3caa2579","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Image Drag is a DSH web sidebar plugin. Hold Ctrl and left-drag a zoomed image or PDF to pan it. Each docked pane has a clear button that leaves its Start page open; split panes stay independent. It uses existing scrolling and zoom. Requires DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 or later; no extra key or service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:327-379","lib/client.js:600-634"]}
